WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Buying your first home can feel like a big step.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.500
It often begins before you have even found the right property.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.500
The first thing to understand is what you could borrow.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:20.400
You may be able to borrow more than you expect, and it helps to know that as you start looking.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:32.700
MortgageEasy helps you get started. You can explore in your own time, or book a conversation when you are ready.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:43.700
That technology means your adviser already understands your situation, and can focus on what matters most.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:57.800
When choosing a mortgage, your adviser will help you find an option that is right for your circumstances.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:02.400
They can also help you prepare to make an offer. When the time is right,

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.400
your adviser can provide an agreement in principle,

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:10.300
giving you confidence that you are ready to move forward.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:19.400
From your initial application to completion, your adviser works with your conveyancer and estate agent.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:22.200
And when you finally open the door to your new home,

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:29.500
it is your moment — and you will have felt more supported.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.300
Your journey, made easier.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.500
Understand what you can borrow.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.000
Find a mortgage that fits you.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.800
Get your Agreement in Principle.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:41.200
Make your offer with confidence.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.000
Move in, protected for what matters.
